---

<DocsLayout
  title="Lunixia"
  description="Journal, understand your moods, track your health, keep notes, explore spiritual tools, earn self-care points, and keep more of your wellbeing connected with Lunixia."
>
  <main class="lunixia-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet Lunixia</p>

        <h1>Understand your inner world, care for your health, and keep what matters close.</h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
          Lunixia is a personal wellbeing companion built around the different
          parts of your day that influence one another. Journal and uncover themes,
          log moods and see emotional patterns, track medications, symptoms, sleep,
          vitals, exercise, water, steps, and naps, keep flexible notes, explore
          spiritual tools, and earn Self-Care Points for the actions you complete.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Lunixia links">
          <a class="primary-button raised-button" href="#features">
            Explore Features
          </a>

          <a class="secondary-button raised-button" href="/contact">
            Contact Support
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-showcase reveal reveal-delay">
        <div class="showcase-card main-card">
          <h4>Reflection, mood, health, notes, and self-care stay connected.</h4>

          <div class="progress-line">
            <span></span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-one">
          <span>Journal Insight</span>
          <strong>Entries, intentions, streaks, and themes</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-two">
          <span>Wellbeing</span>
          <strong>Mood, health, movement, and daily care</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <GradientDivider />

    <section class="intro-section reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">One Connected Picture</p>

      <h2>Your thoughts, emotions, health, reflection, and self-care do not exist separately.</h2>

      <p>
        Lunixia brings the different parts of your day into one place so you can understand them together instead of as isolated pieces. Journal your thoughts, explore recurring themes, log moods and the activities surrounding them, follow your health through medications, symptoms, sleep, vitals, movement, water, and steps, keep meaningful notes, and make space for spiritual reflection--all while building a richer record of how your inner life and everyday experiences change over time.
      </p>
    </section>

